---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="bg-[#f9f9f9]">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-12 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-[72px] relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="">The tools You Need To Grow Repeat Sales</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">Points, VIP, referrals, gift cards, and store credit work seamlessly together to create the ultimate rewards program for your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-14 mt-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Salesforce gift cards" class="text-center" src="/assets/shopify/GC.webp" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class="mt-8 ">Sell Gift Cards - Physical and Digital</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">99minds enables consumers to purchase, send, and create customized Gift Cards through Salesforce both in-store and online.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
          
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Salesforce loyalty program" class="text-center" src="/assets/shopify/LP.webp" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" mt-8">Simple and Dynamic Loyalty Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Introduce an omnichannel loyalty program on Salesforce that elevates both customer lifetime value and marketing effectiveness.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
      </div>
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Salesforce store credit" class="text-center" src="/assets/shopify/SC.webp" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class="mt-8"> Store Credit- Turn Refunds Into Sales</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Offer store credit to your customers on salesforce which can be redeemed both in-store and online.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Salesforce referral program" class="text-center" src="/assets/shopify/RF.webp" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" mt-8">Customisable Referral Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Create a salesforce referral and rewards program that transforms customer advocacy into a key revenue source via SMS, emails, social media, and other channels.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Salesforce coupons" class="text-center" src="/assets/shopify/CG.webp" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Powerful Coupon Generator</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Bulk, dynamic & personalize coupon generation for your store.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Salesforce POS" class="text-center" src="/assets/shopify/POS.webp" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" mt-8">Seamless POS Integration</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">99minds integrates effortlessly with your Point-of-Sale and eCommerce systems, ensuring a unified approach to boost sales
</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto  sm:flex-row">
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 lg:mt-10 mt-4">
          <a href="https://appexchange.salesforce.com/appxListingDetail?listingId=a0N4V00000J6Jc3UAF" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-black absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds on Salesforce</span>
                </span>
          </a>
          </div>
      </div>
</section>
